{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29123","headline":"疾後与郡中羣公讌李秀才 · 许浑","name":"疾後与郡中羣公讌李秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"强留佳客讌王孙，岩上余花落酒樽。\n书院欲开虫网户，讼庭犹掩雀罗门。\n耳虚尽日疑琴癖，眼暗经秋觉镜昏。\n莫引刘安倚西槛，夜来红叶下江村。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29123.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29123","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}